# Line endings as in upstream PuTTY: LF in text files. Git converts
# CRLF to LF when a file is committed, so an editor set to CRLF can't
# bring CRLF back into the repository. Binary files (icons and so on)
# are detected automatically and stored untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Upstream keeps this one file with CRLF line endings; store it as-is.
windows/README-msi.txt -text
